        "original_id": "5c2a583c-3fc2-58a5-9d17-e9ea6ce026e4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christy Cabanne, David Howard, Morton Grant\n- Works: The Stealers, Dude Cowboy\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, silent film actor\n\nFacts:\n- William Christy Cabanne was born on April 16, 1888, and was an American film director, screenwriter, and silent film actor.\n- David Howard was born on October 6, 1896, and was an American film director.\n- The Stealers is a 1920 American silent drama film directed by Christy Cabanne.\n- David Howard directed Dude Cowboy as his final film, and Morton Grant wrote the screenplay.\n- William Christy Cabanne died on October 15, 1950.\n- David Howard died on December 21, 1941.",
